{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ECC","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"傳道書","commonName":"傳道書","title":"傳道書","order":21,"numberOfChapters":12,"sha256":"0820c676ad433f3511909fd6951fb4fcc4ff6d4c48e9ee637e3a4d5e7b84f784","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ECC/1.json","lastChapterNumber":12,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ECC/12.json","totalNumberOfVerses":221},"chapter":{"number":7,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"美好的名聲勝過珍貴的膏油，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人死之日勝過出生之時。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"探望喪家勝過參加宴席，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為死亡是每個人的結局，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"活著的人要把這事銘記在心。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"哀傷勝過歡笑，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為哀傷磨煉心靈。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"智者的心思考死亡，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"愚人的心只顧作樂。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"聽智者的責備，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"勝過聽愚人的頌歌。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"愚人的笑聲像鍋底下燒荊棘的噼啪聲。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這也是虛空。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"欺壓使智者變愚昧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"賄賂敗壞人心。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"事情的結局勝過事情的開端；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"恆久忍耐勝過心驕氣傲。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要輕易發怒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為愚人心懷怒氣。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要問為什麼過去比現在好，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為這樣問不明智。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"智慧如同產業一樣美好，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有益於得見日光的世人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"智慧提供保障，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如同金錢一樣。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"智慧能保全智者的生命。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這就是知識的好處。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你要思想上帝的作為，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為上帝弄彎的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"誰能使它變直呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"順境時要快樂，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"逆境時要思想：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"兩者都是上帝的安排，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好叫人不能預知將來。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["在我虛空的一生中，我見過義人行義，反而滅亡；惡人行惡，卻享長壽。"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["為人不要過分正直，也不要過於聰明，何必自取毀滅呢？"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["不要過分邪惡，也不要做愚人，何必時候未到就死呢？"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["最好是持守這個教訓也不放鬆那個教訓，因為敬畏上帝的人必避免兩個極端。"]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":["智慧使一個智者比城裡十個官長更有能力。"]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":["誠然，在地上無法找到一個一生行善、從未犯罪的義人。"]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":["你不要斤斤計較別人所說的每一句話，免得聽見你的僕人咒詛你，"]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":["因為你心裡知道自己也曾多次咒詛別人。"]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":["我用智慧試驗過這一切。我說：「我要做智者」，誰知智慧卻離我甚遠。"]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":["智慧如此遙不可及、深不可測，誰能找得到呢？"]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":["我用心去認識、探究、追尋智慧和事物的原委，並去認識邪惡帶來的愚昧和無知帶來的狂妄。"]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":["我發現有的婦人比死亡更苦毒，她是個陷阱，心如網羅，手像鎖鏈。討上帝喜悅的人避開她，罪人卻被她俘虜。"]},{"type":"verse","number":27,"content":["傳道者說：「看啊，我事事反復探索，要查明萬事之理，卻沒有尋獲。但我發現在一千個男子中還可以找到一位正直人，在眾女子中卻未找到一位。"]},{"type":"verse","number":29,"content":["我只發現一件事，上帝造的人本來正直，人卻找出各種詭計。」"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ECC/7.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ECC/8.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ECC/6.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":28}